sequenceDiagram
autonumber
participant Person as Docket owner
participant Docket as Docket API
participant Gateway as Lovelace gateway
participant Relay as Lovelace relay
participant Studio as Mac Studio daemon
participant LM as LM Studio / Laguna

    rect rgb(235, 245, 255)
        Note over Person,LM: Athena chat model turn
        Person->>Docket: Ask about an existing Docket task
        Docket->>Gateway: Chat completion for selected runtime
        Gateway->>Relay: Enqueue sealed inference work
        Studio->>Relay: Poll and lease work
        Studio->>LM: Run poolside/laguna-s-2.1
        LM-->>Studio: Model response
        Studio-->>Relay: Return sealed response
        Relay-->>Gateway: Complete request
        Gateway-->>Docket: Completion and correlation ids
        Docket-->>Person: Athena response
    end

    rect rgb(245, 240, 255)
        Note over Person,LM: Personal Athena assignment
        Docket->>Docket: Store prepared delegation, work id, and reply key
        Docket->>Gateway: Submit sealed schema-v2 agent_task
        Gateway->>Relay: Enqueue account-bound work
        Studio->>Relay: Poll and lease work
        Studio->>LM: Run analysis on poolside/laguna-s-2.1
        LM-->>Studio: Assignment result
        Studio-->>Relay: Return sealed progress and result
        Docket->>Gateway: Poll from saved relay cursor
        Gateway-->>Docket: Return sealed events
        Docket->>Docket: Open result and create one proposed comment
        Docket->>Gateway: Acknowledge durably stored terminal result
        Gateway->>Relay: Delete sealed result and progress ciphertext
        Person->>Docket: Approve the proposal
        Docket-->>Person: Show one applied task comment
    end
